338
00:23:41,128 --> 00:23:44,131
Vi fant folka da de kom
inn i luftrommet vårt.

339
00:23:44,214 --> 00:23:45,424
Rutineforbiflyging.

340
00:23:46,175 --> 00:23:47,384
Forstørret bilde.

341
00:23:51,847 --> 00:23:53,057
Smil, tosker.

342
00:23:55,017 --> 00:23:57,686
- Når?
- Kl. 13.50 i dag.

343
00:23:57,770 --> 00:23:58,771
Jeg har koordinatene.

344
00:23:58,854 --> 00:24:00,105
Inn i fartøyene.

345
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:02,483
Takk.

346
00:24:17,289 --> 00:24:19,249
Dra hardt inn!

347
00:24:19,333 --> 00:24:20,918
Dra hardt inn!

348
00:24:28,634 --> 00:24:30,219
Stø kurs.

349
00:24:36,558 --> 00:24:37,559
Maska di.

350
00:24:38,102 --> 00:24:39,687
Jeg har masse tid.

351
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:52,241
Klar bane forut.

352
00:25:08,257 --> 00:25:09,383
Jake!

353
00:25:09,466 --> 00:25:10,759
Mangkwanere!

354
00:25:12,261 --> 00:25:13,262
Røvere. Våpen.

355
00:25:13,554 --> 00:25:14,554
Slå alarm!

356
00:25:21,020 --> 00:25:22,563
- Våpen klare!
- Kom igjen.

357
00:25:22,646 --> 00:25:24,231
- Løp!
- Kom igjen.

358
00:25:24,314 --> 00:25:25,149
Få dem ut.

359
00:25:25,232 --> 00:25:26,608
Kom igjen.
Søk dekning.

360
00:25:37,661 --> 00:25:38,579
Kom igjen.

361
00:25:38,662 --> 00:25:40,289
Beskytt søstrene dine.

362
00:25:40,372 --> 00:25:42,207
Ja. Bli i dekning.

363
00:25:44,209 --> 00:25:45,210
Slå dem tilbake!

364
00:26:10,736 --> 00:26:12,029
Spider, her.

365
00:26:15,991 --> 00:26:17,076
Fanken, sambandet.

366
00:26:30,214 --> 00:26:31,298
Bli hos jentene.

367
00:26:31,381 --> 00:26:32,381
Hvor skal du?

368
00:26:36,220 --> 00:26:37,596
Kompis, bli her.

369
00:27:05,624 --> 00:27:06,625
Kom igjen.

370
00:27:08,335 --> 00:27:09,378
Tøm.

371
00:27:20,889 --> 00:27:22,015
Trekk unna.

372
00:27:22,099 --> 00:27:23,142
Trekk unna.

373
00:28:10,522 --> 00:28:11,523
Jeg er

374
00:28:11,607 --> 00:28:12,900
ilden!

375
00:28:31,835 --> 00:28:32,836
Å, fa…

376
00:28:37,424 --> 00:28:38,425
Hei!

377
00:29:15,963 --> 00:29:17,256
- Tuk.
- Kom igjen.

378
00:29:18,090 --> 00:29:19,424
Klatre.

379
00:29:19,508 --> 00:29:20,968
Opp. Fort.

380
00:29:28,350 --> 00:29:29,351
Spider, ta tak.

381
00:29:29,434 --> 00:29:30,435
Kom igjen.

382
00:29:30,519 --> 00:29:31,519
Hold fast.

383
00:29:58,797 --> 00:30:00,632
Neytiri, hører du?

384
00:30:08,557 --> 00:30:09,599
Dritt, dritt.

385
00:30:11,351 --> 00:30:12,477
- Det er Lo'ak.
- Hvor?

386
00:30:12,561 --> 00:30:14,479
Vi må hente ham.

387
00:30:15,897 --> 00:30:16,898
Lo'ak.

388
00:30:17,232 --> 00:30:18,525
- Hopp.
- Hopp.

389
00:30:18,608 --> 00:30:19,609
Nå!

390
00:30:20,152 --> 00:30:21,361
Kom igjen!

391
00:30:21,445 --> 00:30:22,446
Hold fast, dere.

392
00:30:35,334 --> 00:30:36,543
Hold fast, Lo'ak.

393
00:30:48,305 --> 00:30:50,057
Hold fast. Tuk!

394
00:31:00,233 --> 00:31:02,235
- Spider, beinet mitt.
- Kiri.

395
00:31:06,281 --> 00:31:07,282
Dra.

396
00:31:08,658 --> 00:31:10,160
- Går det det bra?
- Tuk.

397
00:31:10,243 --> 00:31:11,703
Du klarer deg.

398
00:31:11,787 --> 00:31:13,038
Tuk.

399
00:31:13,121 --> 00:31:14,498
Går det bra?

400
00:31:15,540 --> 00:31:16,875
- Går det bra?
- Ja.

401
00:31:17,376 --> 00:31:18,668
Søte jenta mi.

402
00:31:18,752 --> 00:31:19,878
Søte jente.

403
00:31:19,961 --> 00:31:21,046
Unnskyld.

404
00:31:21,129 --> 00:31:22,881
Unnskyld.

405
00:31:22,964 --> 00:31:24,049
- Det er ok.
- Takk.

406
00:31:35,394 --> 00:31:36,395
- Takk.
- Fanken.

407
00:31:37,062 --> 00:31:38,772
Reservemaska er på skipet.

408
00:31:38,855 --> 00:31:39,689
Hva?

409
00:31:39,773 --> 00:31:41,149
Reservemaska er på skipet.

410
00:31:41,775 --> 00:31:43,610
Fanken. Kiri, bli her.

411
00:32:31,491 --> 00:32:33,160
Se. Etter dem!

412
00:32:34,744 --> 00:32:35,912
Vi stikker.

413
00:32:38,540 --> 00:32:39,666
Kom igjen.

414
00:32:39,749 --> 00:32:41,501
Kiri, løp.
De kommer.

415
00:32:42,752 --> 00:32:43,752
Løp.

416
00:32:47,007 --> 00:32:48,675
De kommer.
Kom igjen.

417
00:32:49,384 --> 00:32:50,802
Fortsett. Løp, løp.

418
00:32:52,387 --> 00:32:54,097
- Kiri, denne veien.
- Tuk.

419
00:32:54,806 --> 00:32:55,807
- Kom igjen.
- Fort.

420
00:33:19,873 --> 00:33:21,625
- Fortsett.
- Fort.

421
00:33:25,253 --> 00:33:27,255
- Hva skjedde?
- Snu ham.

422
00:33:29,424 --> 00:33:30,425
En går gjennom.

423
00:33:31,510 --> 00:33:32,761
Tsahik, se.

424
00:33:39,267 --> 00:33:40,268
Kniv.

425
00:33:47,442 --> 00:33:48,443
Følg meg.

426
00:34:02,249 --> 00:34:04,292
- Kom igjen.
- Tuk, her.

427
00:34:11,007 --> 00:34:12,007
Der!

428
00:34:17,931 --> 00:34:18,848
De kommer.

429
00:34:18,932 --> 00:34:19,683
Tuk.

430
00:34:19,766 --> 00:34:20,976
Kiri, kom igjen.

431
00:34:21,059 --> 00:34:22,561
Denne veien. Løp.

432
00:34:24,354 --> 00:34:25,355
Fortsett.

433
00:34:29,192 --> 00:34:30,944
- Denne veien, Tuk.
- Fort.

434
00:34:31,027 --> 00:34:32,027
Ned i vannet.

435
00:34:32,362 --> 00:34:34,531
Løp, løp.
Kom igjen.

436
00:34:34,614 --> 00:34:36,074
- Kom igjen.
- Lo'ak!

437
00:34:36,157 --> 00:34:37,826
Svøm!

438
00:34:41,788 --> 00:34:42,998
Lo'ak!

439
00:34:43,081 --> 00:34:44,165
Jeg har deg, Tuk.

440
00:34:44,249 --> 00:34:45,125
Det er ok.

441
00:34:45,208 --> 00:34:46,208
Hva sier pappa?

442
00:34:46,626 --> 00:34:48,169
Sullyer holder sammen.

443
00:34:48,670 --> 00:34:49,671
Nei, det andre.

444
00:34:50,213 --> 00:34:51,214
Sullyer gir seg aldri.

445
00:34:51,298 --> 00:34:52,298
Nettopp.

446
00:34:52,591 --> 00:34:53,633
Sullyer gir seg aldri.

447
00:34:57,596 --> 00:34:58,597
Ingenting.

448
00:34:59,431 --> 00:35:00,140
Kiri.

449
00:35:00,223 --> 00:35:01,558
- Lo'ak.
- Hold fast.

450
00:35:01,641 --> 00:35:02,642
Hold fast.

451
00:35:06,396 --> 00:35:07,396
Kiri.

452
00:35:08,481 --> 00:35:09,481
Kiri.

453
00:35:10,900 --> 00:35:11,901
Spider.

454
00:35:13,570 --> 00:35:14,863
Det går bra.
Ta hånda mi.

455
00:35:24,623 --> 00:35:25,749
Ørneøyne, hører du?

456
00:35:32,130 --> 00:35:34,466
Lo'ak, svar.

457
00:35:42,724 --> 00:35:44,309
Neytiri, hører du meg?

458
00:35:47,354 --> 00:35:48,396
Neytiri,

459
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:49,481
hører du meg?

460
00:35:51,399 --> 00:35:52,734
Hører du meg?

461
00:35:54,653 --> 00:35:55,654
Hva…

462
00:35:56,446 --> 00:35:57,447
Tuk.

463
00:35:59,240 --> 00:36:00,241
Svøm.

464
00:36:01,159 --> 00:36:02,160
Kom igjen.

465
00:36:03,620 --> 00:36:05,038
- Grip en stein.
- Kom igjen.

466
00:36:05,664 --> 00:36:06,665
Jeg har deg, Tuk.

467
00:36:12,837 --> 00:36:14,297
- Er alle i orden?
- Her.

468
00:36:14,381 --> 00:36:15,882
Går det bra, Spider?

469
00:36:15,965 --> 00:36:17,217
Ja.

470
00:36:26,601 --> 00:36:27,852
Så du dem?

471
00:36:29,020 --> 00:36:31,648
Nei. La oss gjemme oss.

472
00:36:31,731 --> 00:36:32,899
Jeg vil hjem.

473
00:36:32,982 --> 00:36:34,192
Tuk, kom igjen.

474
00:36:34,275 --> 00:36:35,819
Jeg er sliten og sulten.

475
00:36:35,902 --> 00:36:38,530
- Jeg vil hjem.
- Jeg også. Vi drar hjem.

476
00:36:38,613 --> 00:36:39,864
Pappa vet ikke hvor vi er.

477
00:36:40,240 --> 00:36:41,491
Vi har ikke samband.

478
00:36:43,326 --> 00:36:44,661
Vi må klare oss selv.

479
00:36:45,537 --> 00:36:47,122
Jeg må få tak i ei maske.

480
00:36:47,205 --> 00:36:48,790
Hva skal vi gjøre?

481
00:36:48,873 --> 00:36:50,709
Vet ikke.
Hvorfor er jeg leder?

482
00:36:51,376 --> 00:36:54,003
Ro deg ned.
Vi må gjøre noe.

483
00:36:54,087 --> 00:36:55,088
Hold kjeft.

484
00:36:56,423 --> 00:36:57,424
- Lo'ak.
- Dritt.

485
00:36:57,966 --> 00:36:58,967
Dritt, dritt.

486
00:36:59,050 --> 00:37:00,552
Vi må tilbake til skipet.

487
00:37:00,635 --> 00:37:01,720
Vi kan ikke.

488
00:37:01,803 --> 00:37:03,471
De folka er i veien.

489
00:37:03,555 --> 00:37:05,765
Det er
vår siste kjente posisjon.

490
00:37:05,849 --> 00:37:07,142
Der vil pappa lete.

491
00:37:07,225 --> 00:37:08,727
- Nei.
- Vi går rundt dem.

492
00:37:08,810 --> 00:37:10,520
Det er lurt.
Hvilken vei?

493
00:37:13,314 --> 00:37:15,442
Denne veien.
Følg meg.

494
00:37:22,574 --> 00:37:23,867
Det er slutt, Jake.

495
00:37:29,998 --> 00:37:31,875
Ikke rør deg.

496
00:37:35,795 --> 00:37:36,796
Er det alt du kan?

497
00:37:37,464 --> 00:37:39,591
Det holder.

498
00:37:39,674 --> 00:37:41,926
Fortsatt viktigper.
Få se hendene.

499
00:37:42,802 --> 00:37:44,012
Hendene.

500
00:37:45,680 --> 00:37:47,557
Jeg drepte deg.

501
00:37:51,811 --> 00:37:54,147
Jeg dør visst ikke
så lett, korporal.

502
00:38:02,739 --> 00:38:03,740
Hjelp meg.

503
00:38:16,085 --> 00:38:17,420
Hvem angrep dere?

504
00:38:18,296 --> 00:38:19,589
Mangkwan-røvere.

505
00:38:20,256 --> 00:38:22,050
De kaller seg "askefolk".

506
00:38:23,760 --> 00:38:25,136
Hva er dette?

507
00:38:25,220 --> 00:38:26,262
De skar over kuruen.

508
00:38:26,346 --> 00:38:28,306
De tar fiendenes to'a,
kraften deres.

509
00:38:28,932 --> 00:38:30,391
Det er verre enn døden.

510
00:38:34,187 --> 00:38:35,271
Noen tegn til dem?

511
00:38:35,355 --> 00:38:36,356
Ungene er borte.

512
00:38:37,816 --> 00:38:38,817
Den er fulladet.

513
00:38:38,900 --> 00:38:41,820
Altså byttet han ikke maske,
og batteriet tømmes.

514
00:38:41,903 --> 00:38:43,321
Om ikke askefolket

515
00:38:43,404 --> 00:38:45,198
får tak i ham først.

516
00:38:45,281 --> 00:38:46,908
Vi må dra etter ungene nå,

517
00:38:46,991 --> 00:38:48,535
ellers ser du ham ikke mer.

518
00:38:52,163 --> 00:38:53,164
Kan du spore dem?

519
00:38:53,248 --> 00:38:55,166
Det er ikke oppdraget.
Hva gjør vi?

520
00:38:55,250 --> 00:38:56,251
Kan du spore dem?

521
00:38:56,751 --> 00:38:58,253
Vi kaster bort tid.

522
00:38:58,336 --> 00:39:00,296
Sjef, vi har ham.
Vi drar.

523
00:39:02,340 --> 00:39:04,968
La håndjernene være på.
Hvilken vei?

524
00:39:09,013 --> 00:39:11,015
Du vil få meg drept.

525
00:39:11,099 --> 00:39:12,433
Igjen.

526
00:39:15,687 --> 00:39:17,021
Denne veien.

527
00:39:20,275 --> 00:39:21,901
Elva må være
like ved. Kom.

528
00:39:30,535 --> 00:39:31,661
Spider.

529
00:39:32,370 --> 00:39:33,621
Kompis.

530
00:39:33,705 --> 00:39:35,582
- Ikke bra.
- Hva kan vi gjøre?

531
00:39:35,665 --> 00:39:37,584
Spar på lufta, Apegutt.

532
00:39:38,042 --> 00:39:39,168
Se på meg.

533
00:39:39,711 --> 00:39:40,920
Pust langsomt.

534
00:39:41,004 --> 00:39:42,255
Lo'ak…

535
00:39:42,338 --> 00:39:43,673
- …kan du bære ham?
